{
  "script_id": "seashell-surface",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55440,
      "text": "捡起一枚海螺，你会发现一件奇怪的事：它从幼体长到成体，形状几乎没变，只是整体变大了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.46,
      "size": 55440,
      "text": "这不是巧合。海螺的生长遵循一条极简的规律：每转一圈，所有尺寸乘上同一个固定倍数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.74,
      "size": 43776,
      "text": "这条规律叫自相似生长，它在数学上对应一条特殊的曲线，叫对数螺线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "logspiral",
      "line_id": "lg-1",
      "filename": "logspiral-lg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/logspiral-lg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.48,
      "size": 55728,
      "text": "对数螺线有一个漂亮得不可思议的性质。从原点向曲线上任意一点画一条线，再画出该点的切线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "logspiral",
      "line_id": "lg-2",
      "filename": "logspiral-lg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/logspiral-lg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.23,
      "size": 51696,
      "text": "这两条线的夹角，在螺线上每一个点都完全相同。无论离原点多近多远，角度纹丝不动。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "logspiral",
      "line_id": "lg-3",
      "filename": "logspiral-lg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/logspiral-lg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.18,
      "size": 66816,
      "text": "这个恒定的角就是生长角，我们叫它 α。屏幕上显示的实测值处处等于 α，误差在小数点后五位以内。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "growth",
      "line_id": "gr-1",
      "filename": "growth-gr-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/growth-gr-1.mp3",
      "duration": 4.17,
      "size": 66672,
      "text": "定角性质的代价是半径必须按指数增长。具体说，半径等于 e 的 u 乘余切 α 次方，其中 u 是盘绕角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "growth",
      "line_id": "gr-2",
      "filename": "growth-gr-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/growth-gr-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.17,
      "size": 66672,
      "text": "由此可以算出每绕一圈的放大倍数：e 的二倍圆周率乘余切 α 次方。这是一个只依赖 α 的常数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "growth",
      "line_id": "gr-3",
      "filename": "growth-gr-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/growth-gr-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.8,
      "size": 60768,
      "text": "把这个因子同时作用在螺线半径和管截面半径上，海螺的形状就出来了。截面跟着放大，所以形状不变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-1",
      "filename": "verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "size": 60624,
      "text": "怎么确认真的自相似？取曲面上任意一点，再取盘绕角增加二倍圆周率后的对应点，也就是转了整整一圈。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-2",
      "filename": "verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.8,
      "size": 60768,
      "text": "比较这两点的横坐标之比和纵坐标之比。如果自相似成立，两个比值应该相等，而且都等于那个放大倍数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "verify",
      "line_id": "vf-3",
      "filename": "verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/verify-vf-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.09,
      "size": 49392,
      "text": "实测结果精确吻合到小数点后八位。这就是自相似的严格验证，不是看起来像而已。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-1",
      "filename": "tune-tn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/tune-tn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.64,
      "size": 58176,
      "text": "请拖动生长角滑块。α 越接近九十度，余切越小，放大倍数越接近一，螺体就越扁平。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-2",
      "filename": "tune-tn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/tune-tn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.87,
      "size": 61920,
      "text": "α 减小则放大迅速。标准海螺取一点四七，每圈放大约一点八九倍，绕三圈累计六点七倍。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "tune",
      "line_id": "tn-3",
      "filename": "tune-tn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/tune-tn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.2,
      "size": 67248,
      "text": "注意别把 α 调得太小。取一点三五时每圈放大四倍，绕三圈就是六十八倍，最外圈会占满整个画面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.94,
      "size": 47088,
      "text": "第一，海螺的生长是自相似的：每转一圈所有尺寸乘同一常数，所以形状不变。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "size": 44928,
      "text": "第二，对数螺线的定角性质是这一切的根源，径向与切向的夹角处处相同。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "seashell-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/seashell-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.03,
      "size": 64512,
      "text": "第三，放大倍数等于 e 的二倍圆周率乘余切 α 次方，只由生长角决定。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
